This repository contains scripts and measurements for an FP8 quantization of AMALIA-9B.

The model itself is the work of the AMALIA team and is published separately:
  https://huggingface.co/amalia-llm/AMALIA-9B-0626-DPO  (Apache 2.0)

The quantized artifact produced by this work:
  https://huggingface.co/CYBERS3C/AMALIA-9B-0626-DPO-FP8  (Apache 2.0)

All credit for the model belongs to the AMALIA team. This repository contributes a
quantization and the measurements behind it, nothing more.
